    [9533]={name="Masons Fraternity Ring",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Divino-matic Rod” — pick it over the other choices. In Zul'Farrak.",zone="Zul'Farrak",questName="Divino-matic Rod",lore="Sergeant Bly stole from me! He said he'd only borrow it, but he stole my cherished divino-matic rod!! Without that rod how will I know where to dig new water holes??"},
    [9598]={name="Sleeping Robes",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Druid of the Claw” — pick it over the other choices. In Teldrassil.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="Druid of the Claw",lore="After examining this charm, I see now what must be done. Please take it, and do as I ask. You are to explore the deepest areas of the Ban'ethil Barrow Den."},
    [9601]={name="Cushioned Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Sathrah's Sacrifice” — pick it over the other choices. In Darnassus.",zone="Darnassus",questName="Sathrah's Sacrifice",lore="Now you must finish the task to which you have been appointed. Take the spinnerets and offer Lady Sathrah's sacrifice to Elune; lay the great spider to rest."},
    [9603]={name="Gritroot Staff",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Relics of Wakening” — pick it over the other choices. In Teldrassil.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Relics of Wakening",lore="Gnarlpine invaders were seen ravaging the Ban'ethil Barrow Den to the west. The slumbering druids will be trapped in the Emerald Dream for eternity, unaware of their fate, unless we help."},
    [9624]={name="Triprunner Dungarees",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Rig Wars” — pick it over the other choices. In Gnomeregan.",zone="Gnomeregan",questName="Rig Wars",lore="Gnome technology - two years ago its most common use was as a punch line. Times certainly have changed. Now they've got a new rig built that's better than all our shredder models combined."},
    [9630]={name="Pratt's Handcrafted Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Mark of Quality” — pick it over the other choices. In Feralas.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Mark of Quality",lore="My philosophy on leatherworking is that the work must be the best quality possible - no compromises. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter is trying to sell you ocean-front property in Dun Morogh!"},
    [9633]={name="Jangdor's Handcrafted Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Mark of Quality” — pick it over the other choices. In Feralas.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Mark of Quality",lore="I take pride in my leather work, and I feel it shows; quality should never be compromised. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter would also have you believe that the earth does not keep secrets!"},
    [9650]={name="Honorguard Chestpiece",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Venom to the Undercity” — pick it over the other choices. In The Hinterlands.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Venom to the Undercity",lore="The venom you gathered from the Witherbark's spider god is quite a find! I've been able to kill nearly two dozen rabbits with just a drop of the stuff."},
    [9663]={name="Dawnrider's Chestpiece",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Delivering the Relic” — pick it over the other choices. In Feralas.",zone="Feralas",questName="Delivering the Relic",lore="If you would be so kind as to deliver the relic to my wife Vestia, I would appreciate it. She's not only a fine priestess for our community, but she is one of the most well-versed scholars you'll find anywhere."},
    [9684]={name="Force of the Hippogryph",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Weapons of Spirit” — pick it over the other choices. In Feralas.",zone="Feralas",questName="Weapons of Spirit",lore="Imbuing the muisek into the weapons is a difficult process. Now that I have all of the required materials and the muisek of the creatures that you captured, I may begin."},
